A '''river''' that flowed through [[Theed]] was located on the [[Mid Rim Territories|Mid Rim]] [[planet]] [[Naboo]].<ref name="Resolve" /> In [[19 BBY]],<ref name="Date">"[[Resolve (episode)|Resolve]]" begins with [[Padmé Amidala Naberrie|Padmé Amidala]]'s [[Padmé Amidala's funeral|funeral]], which is dated to [[19 BBY]] by ''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''.</ref> [[Ahsoka Tano]] and former [[Clone Commander]] [[Rex]] parked their [[Rex's BTL-B Y-wing fighter-bomber|BTL-B Y-wing fighter-bomber]] by the river so that the former could attend the [[Padmé Amidala's funeral|funeral]] of [[Padmé Amidala Naberrie|Padmé Amidala]].<ref name="Resolve" />

